      "message": "Relying on a static reference here is problematic. In lieu of a deeper change to better handle callbacks across lifecycle changes, can we instead have the static method `show` set this value onto the Dialog, as well as handle null checks for it.\n\n```\nprivate Enable16kbPagesDialogHost mHost \u003d null;\n\nprivate void setHost(@NonNull Enable16kbPagesDialogHost host) {\n    mHost \u003d host;\n}\n\nprivate static void show(@NonNull Fragment hostFragment, @NonNull Enable16kbPagesDialogHost host) {\n    ...\n    Fragment existingFragment \u003d manager.findFragmentByTag(TAG);\n    if (existingFragment \u003d\u003d null) {\n        existingFragment \u003d new Enable16kPagesWarningDialog();\n        ...\n    }\n    if (existingFragment instanceof Enable16kPagesWarningDialog) {\n        existingFragment.setHost(host);\n    }\n}\n```",
      "revId": "b2b59937d88d66a616d5829ef78e9d92c4f2018c",
